# Write a pull request body to the skill — always apply

Before you write or rewrite the body of a pull request, in this repository or any repository it
routes to: read and apply
[`writing-pull-requests/SKILL.md`](../skills/writing-pull-requests/SKILL.md).

## Forbidden

- Writing a pull request body from your own defaults, or from the shape of a body you saw earlier.
- Dropping a section because the change looks small. A small change gets a short section.
- Ticking a checkbox in the repo's template. That field is the human author's attestation.
